### Local environment ###
# Not how this repo configures local runs - that is the `local` Spring profile in
# src/main/resources/application-local.yaml. Ignored anyway so that a .env someone creates out of
# habit, or that a tool drops in, cannot be committed with a real credential in it.
# A template named exactly .env.example stays committable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
